# --- Experiment results. The 140 pattern files total 166 MB but hold only 15 distinct
#     contents: the repeated E8 runs write byte-identical output, which is precisely what E8
#     measured, and the published build writes empty files. One representative of each distinct
#     content is committed below; output/MANIFEST_output.csv names all 140 originals with their
#     size, MD5 and representative, so nothing is lost. Regenerate both the manifest and this
#     list with `py -I tools/manifest_output.py`. ---
output/*.txt
!output/ablation_E0.txt
!output/accidents_f_13000000.txt
!output/accidents_f_19000000_minavg1.txt
!output/chess_f_150000.txt
